{"id": "en_thin_ice_p2", "total": 72.15, "segments": [{"text": "Part two begins as Cole stands frozen on the shore with heavy wet clothes.", "start": 0.0, "end": 3.94}, {"text": "His soaked fabric turns into rigid armor in the freezing winter air right now.", "start": 4.58, "end": 8.02}, {"text": "One. Cole refuses to stay still because movement generates vital body heat today.", "start": 8.273, "end": 13.1}, {"text": "Two. He uses every remaining ounce of strength to shed the frozen layers fast.", "start": 12.87, "end": 17.78}, {"text": "Three. Cole finds dry shelter among the dense trees protecting him from wind.", "start": 17.450000000000003, "end": 22.46}, {"text": "He remembers the 1-10-1 rule protected his life during the terrifying frozen ordeal.", "start": 22.96, "end": 27.44}, {"text": "That means 1 minute for breathing and 10 minutes of movement before danger strikes.", "start": 27.44, "end": 31.6}, {"text": "It also means about 1 hour of total consciousness before severe hypothermia sets in.", "start": 32.28, "end": 36.28}, {"text": "Cole survives the deadly lake because he stays calm and follows every safety rule.", "start": 37.22, "end": 40.84}, {"text": "Cold water survival demands absolute mental discipline and precise physical actions every time.", "start": 41.68, "end": 46.2}, {"text": "Never underestimate the deadly power of thin ice during the freezing winter season.", "start": 47.04, "end": 50.08}, {"text": "Always test the surface carefully and know the crucial rules of self rescue.", "start": 50.96, "end": 54.06}, {"text": "One simple mistake on frozen water can cost you everything in mere seconds.", "start": 54.75, "end": 58.16}, {"text": "Knowledge is your absolute best protection when unexpected outdoor dangers happen to you.", "start": 59.02, "end": 62.46}, {"text": "Always respect the ice and share these vital survival skills with your friends.", "start": 63.08, "end": 66.04}, {"text": "Stay safe out there and follow for a new scenario tom